usage: sdp <command> [subcommand] [flags]

Card commands:
  sdp card <create|show|clarify|needs-input|ready|park|execute|heartbeat|feedback|feedback-export|message-export|resume|resume-import|reply-ingest|deliver>

Board commands:
  sdp board <build|show>

Doctor commands:
  sdp doctor control
  sdp doctor adapters [--manifest <path>] [--out <dir>] [--strict]
  sdp doctor backlog

Dispatch commands:
  sdp dispatch card
  sdp dispatch next

Result commands:
  sdp result ingest

Orchestrate commands:
  sdp orchestrate once

Query commands (require beads/dual mode):
  sdp why <card-id>           Show why a card is blocked
  sdp next [--limit N]        Show next actionable items (default 10)
  sdp missing [project-id]    Show items lacking evidence
  sdp approve <card-id>       Resolve a human gate
  sdp trace <card-id>         Show full feature trace

Deploy commands:
  sdp deploy staging [project-root]
  sdp deploy prod <staging-image-tag> [project-root]
  sdp deploy rollback <previous-tag> [project-root]

Discovery commands (Stage 0):
  sdp discover "raw idea"    Run discovery pipeline (FRAME + SCAN + checkpoint)

Pipeline commands:
  sdp intent "description"   Create intake card from raw intent
  sdp status <card-id>        Show card status and phase
  sdp stuck                  Show stuck/long-running cards
  sdp eval <card-id>         Run build evaluation manually
  sdp clarify <card-id>      Run clarification manually
  sdp plan <card-id>         Show plan for a card
  sdp approve-plan <card-id> Approve a pending plan

Phase commands:
  sdp phase plan [--feature-id ID] [--ws-id ID] [--run-id ID] [--strict]
  sdp phase review [--feature-id ID] [--ws-id ID] [--run-id ID] [--strict]
  sdp phase eval [--feature-id ID] [--ws-id ID] [--run-id ID] [--strict]

Other:
  sdp attention

Scout commands:
  sdp scout [--format json|text|card] [--output DIR] <repo-path>

Spec commands:
  sdp spec [--format json|text] [--category api|rules|invariants|sla] [--output DIR] [--enrich] [--diff] <repo-path>

Index commands:
  sdp index build [--format json|text] <repo-path>
  sdp index stats <repo-path>
  sdp index manifest [--output DIR] <repo-path>

Bootstrap commands:
  sdp bootstrap [--dry-run] [--force] [--beads] [--yes] [--auto-curate] [--only TYPES] <repo-path>
  sdp bootstrap status <repo-path>

Rules commands:
  sdp rules update <repo-path> [--source-evidence=<dir>] [--manifest=<file>] [--format json|text]

Build commands:
  sdp build "<idea>" [--strict] [--local] [--sandbox=<type>] [--dry-run] [--format json|text] [--output DIR] [--timeout DURATION]

Reset commands:
  sdp reset --feature F042 [--dry-run] [--yes]  Reset checkpoint for a feature

Install and adapter commands:
  sdp init [--harness <list>] [--target <dir>] [--manifest <path>] [--update]
  sdp manifest validate [--manifest <path>] [--schema <path>]
  sdp manifest parity [--write]
  sdp generate-adapters [--manifest <path>] [--out <dir>] [--check]

Coverage commands:
  sdp coverage-scan [--path DIR] [--threshold PCT] [--format text|json] [--skip-test] [--package PATTERN] [--coverprofile FILE]

Skills commands:
  sdp skills augment --stack <config.json> [--skills-dir DIR] [--dry-run] [--validate] [-v]
  sdp skills update [--project-root DIR] [--dry-run] [-v]

Telemetry commands:
  sdp telemetry init --feature <bead_id>
  sdp telemetry span-start --kind <kind> --name <name>
  sdp telemetry span-end --span-id <id>
  sdp telemetry daemon
